# Trivy ignore list — accepted CVEs / findings for this repository.
#
# One entry per accepted finding. Each entry MUST be documented with the
# reason it was accepted and a review date, using this exact format:
#
#   # CVE-XXXX-YYYYY  # accepted: <reason>, revisit on <date>
#   CVE-XXXX-YYYYY
#
# Do not add an entry without a documented reason and a revisit date — an
# undocumented suppression is indistinguishable from an oversight during
# review. Remove the entry once the revisit date has passed and re-evaluate.
